+        "effort": "low"
+      },
+      {
+        "category": "speed",
+        "issue": "Mobile lab performance is moderate (score 72, LCP 4.9 s, FCP 3.5 s). Render-blocking requests are the largest estimated saving, at 4,060 ms.",
